<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>全球外媒热点 (10家去重版)</title><link>https://github.com</link><description>BBC/CNBC/FT/经济学人/纽时/WSJ/彭博/路透/美联社/CNN 48小时跨批次去重聚合</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:00:05 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>[彭博社] 为什么今年感恩节这么贵？</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/why-is-thanksgiving-so-expensive-this-year</link><description>计划你的感恩节杂货采购活动吗？您可能会注意到今年过道发生了一些变化。从消失的“免费火鸡”促销活动到牛奶价格上涨近 8%，迪娜·尚克 (Deena Shanker) 与马克斯·查夫金 (Max Chafkin) 共同探讨了感恩节晚餐的真正成本，以及目前杂货价格的推动因素。无论您在何处获取播客，都可以收听完整剧集。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/why-is-thanksgiving-so-expensive-this-year'&gt;为什么今年感恩节这么贵？&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Why Is Thanksgiving So Expensive This Year?&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/why-is-thanksgiving-so-expensive-this-year</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:56:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] BC Partners 收购 GSE 体育经纪公司，高尔夫球手德尚博也在其中</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/bc-partners-buys-gse-sport-agency-with-golfer-dechambeau-on-list</link><description>BC Partners 的信贷部门已同意购买 GSE Worldwide 的多数股权，GSE Worldwide 是一家体育营销机构，代表高尔夫名人布赖森·德尚博 (Bryson DeChambeau) 和前 NFL 和 MLB 球星博·杰克逊 (Bo Jackson) 等运动员。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/bc-partners-buys-gse-sport-agency-with-golfer-dechambeau-on-list'&gt;BC Partners 收购 GSE 体育经纪公司，高尔夫球手德尚博也在其中&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：BC Partners Buys GSE Sport Agency With Golfer DeChambeau on List&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/bc-partners-buys-gse-sport-agency-with-golfer-dechambeau-on-list</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:01:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 股市崩盘蔓延至不太可能的市场，套利交易陷入困境</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stocks-meltdown-spills-into-unlikely-market-sinking-carry-trade</link><description>华尔街 2026 年最可靠的押注之一正开始失去其万无一失的地位。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stocks-meltdown-spills-into-unlikely-market-sinking-carry-trade'&gt;股市崩盘蔓延至不太可能的市场，套利交易陷入困境&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks Meltdown Spills Into Unlikely Market, Sinking Carry Trade&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stocks-meltdown-spills-into-unlikely-market-sinking-carry-trade</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:01:11 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[纽约时报] 爱荷华州爆炸的陆军地图可能低估了影响</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/us/army-detonation-emissions-maps-risk-underestimated.html</link><description>陆军官员计算的紧急排放情景并未按照环境保护局的要求使用“最坏情况情景”。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/us/army-detonation-emissions-maps-risk-underestimated.html'&gt;爱荷华州爆炸的陆军地图可能低估了影响&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Army’s Maps of Iowa Explosion May Underestimate Impact&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/us/army-detonation-emissions-maps-risk-underestimated.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:02:21 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 美国威胁对巴西飞机征收关税，巴西航空工业公司股价下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/embraer-sinks-most-since-may-as-us-proposes-brazil-aircraft-levy</link><description>在美国提议对巴西飞机征收 10% 关税后，巴西航空工业公司 (Embraer SA) 股价创下六个多月来最大跌幅，威胁到该飞机制造商在其最重要市场之一的业务。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b