/www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/jpmorgan-backs-drone-engine-maker-s-10-million-muni-bond-sale</link><description>一家无人机发动机制造商在美国市政债券市场首次亮相，债务背后有一个熟悉的名字：摩根大通公司。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/jpmorgan-backs-drone-engine-maker-s-10-million-muni-bond-sale'&gt;摩根大通支持无人机发动机制造商在威斯康星州的市政出售&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：JPMorgan Backs Drone Engine Maker’s Muni Sale in Wisconsin&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/jpmorgan-backs-drone-engine-maker-s-10-million-muni-bond-sale</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:20:02 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 印度航空首席执行官寻求今年削减 6.5 亿美元成本</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/air-india-chief-seeks-to-cut-650-million-in-costs-this-year</link><description>据知情人士透露，印度航空有限公司希望本财年削减 600 亿卢比（6.5 亿美元）的成本，其新任首席执行官概述了振兴塔塔集团旗下航空公司的举措，该航空公司在截至 3 月份的财年中出现了创纪录的亏损。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/air-india-chief-seeks-to-cut-650-million-in-costs-this-year'&gt;印度航空首席执行官寻求今年削减 6.5 亿美元成本&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Air India Chief Seeks to Cut $650 Million in Costs This Year&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/air-india-chief-seeks-to-cut-650-million-in-costs-this-year</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:20:13 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 双线资本 (DoubleLine) 的科恩 (Cohen) 在遭遇 AI 债务抛售后，从憎恨者转变为热爱人工智能债务的人</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/doubleline-s-cohen-turns-ai-debt-lover-from-hater-after-selloff</link><description>人工智能债务已经变得足够便宜，足以吸引双线资本的罗伯特·科恩，他曾警告该行业可能存在泡沫。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/doubleline-s-cohen-turns-ai-debt-lover-from-hater-after-selloff'&gt;双线资本 (DoubleLine) 的科恩 (Cohen) 在遭遇 AI 债务抛售后，从憎恨者转变为热爱人工智能债务的人&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：DoubleLine’s Cohen Turns AI Debt Lover From Hater After Selloff&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/doubleline-s-cohen-turns-ai-debt-lover-from-hater-after-selloff</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:27:51 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 迪拜银行合并将打造 1,590 亿美元的伊斯兰贷款巨头</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/dubai-bank-merger-to-create-159-billion-islamic-lending-giant</link><description>迪拜伊斯兰银行 PJSC 表示，它将收购阿联酋伊斯兰银行 PJSC，该交易将创建世界上最大的上市伊斯兰银行集团之一，资产约为 1,590 亿美元。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/dubai-bank-merger-to-create-159-billion-islamic-lending-giant'&gt;迪拜银行合并将打造 1,590 亿美元的伊斯兰贷款巨头&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Dubai Bank Merger to Create $159 Billion Islamic Lending Giant&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/dubai-bank-merger-to-create-159-billion-islamic-lending-giant</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:48:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 哈塞特看到了“金发姑娘”经济</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/hassett-sees-a-goldilocks-economy-video</link><description>白宫经济顾问凯文·哈塞特表示，强劲的投资和增长表明经济处于“金发姑娘”状态，通胀并未加速。他还对美联储政策、英伟达的国家重要性以及即将举行的丽莎库克听证会发表了看法。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/hassett-sees-a-goldilocks-economy-video'&gt;哈塞特看到了“金发姑娘”经济&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Hassett Sees a “Goldilocks” Economy&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/hassett-sees-a-goldilocks-economy-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:49:47 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[金融时报] 美国GDP数据升级使美联储12月加息发挥作用</title><link>https://www.ft.com/content/a1aaf5be-176c-4c4c-99d6-00875f6933f3?syn-25a6b1a6=1</link><description>经济分析局表示，第三季度经济年化增长率为 4.3%，高于最初预测的 3.4%&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[金融时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.ft.com/content/a1aaf5be-176c-4c4c-99d6-00875f6933f3?syn-25a6b1a6=1'&gt;美国GDP数据升级使美联储12月加息发挥作用&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Upgrade to US GDP figures keeps December rate rise in play for Fed&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.ft.com/content/a1aaf5be-176c-4c4c-99d6-00875f6933f3?syn-25a6b1a6=1</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:07:13 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[BBC] 由于对人工智能的担忧加剧，美股进一步下跌</title><link>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cq0md8g14zryo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss</link><description>美国三大股指早盘均下跌，其中以科技股为主的纳斯达克指数下跌近 4%。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[BBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cq0md8g14zryo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss'&gt;由于对人工智能的担忧加剧，美股进一步下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US stocks fall further as fears over AI intensify&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cq0md8g14zryo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:07:26 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 欧洲柴油需求将降至新冠水平以下</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/europe-diesel-demand-on-course-to-fall-below-covid-levels</link><description>今年欧洲的柴油需求肯定会低于新冠大流行期间，这表明伊朗战争正在打击石油消费并挤压消费者的钱包。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/europe-diesel-demand-on-course-to-fall-below-covid-levels'&gt;欧洲柴油需求将降至新冠水平以下&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Europe Diesel Demand on Course to Fall Below Covid Levels&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/europe-diesel-demand-on-course-to-fall-below-covid-levels</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:13:35 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] The RealReal 首席执行官看到转售的结构转变</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/the-realreal-ceo-sees-resale-s-structural-shift-video</link><description>数据显示，十月份消费者支出陷入停滞。 RealReal 首席执行官 Rati Sahi Levesque 加入 Bloomberg Open Interest，谈论她所看到的以及购物者如何转向转售以获取价值。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/the-realreal-ceo-sees-resale-s-structural-shift-video'&gt;The RealReal 首席执行官看到转售的结构转变&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：The RealReal CEO Sees Resale’s Structural Shift&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/the-realreal-ceo-sees-resale-s-structural-shift-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:15:46 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 10 月份核心 PCE 势头依然强劲</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/core-pce-momentum-remained-elevated-in-october-video</link><description>美国消费者支出在今年早些时候激增后，于 10 月份陷入停滞，这表明家庭在进入假期季节时稍作喘息。根据周三公布的经济分析局数据，经通胀调整后的个人支出与一个月前相比几乎没有变化。加拿大皇家银行美国高级经济学家迈克·里德对通胀数据做出反应。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/core-pce-momentum-remained-elevated-in-october-video'&gt;10 月份核心 PCE 势头依然强劲&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Core PCE Momentum Remained Elevated in October&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/core-pce-momentum-remained-elevated-in-october-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:19:34 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[纽约时报] 华盛顿再次变蓝，企业监管加强</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/corporate-america-democrats.html</link><description>经过两年的放松管制后，由民主党领导的国会委员会将把聚光灯重新聚焦到美国企业界。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/corporate-america-democrats.html'&gt;华盛顿再次变蓝，企业监管加强&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Corporate Oversight Revs Up as Washington Turns Blue Again&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/corporate-america-democrats.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:27:37 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 雷斯塔称，俄罗斯炼油厂运行跌至数十年来最低水平</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/russian-refinery-runs-plunge-to-lowest-in-decades-rystad-says</link><description>Rystad Energy表示，随着乌克兰继续袭击炼油厂，俄罗斯的石油加工率已降至二十多年来的最低水平，给该国国内燃料供应带来压力。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/russian-refinery-runs-plunge-to-lowest-in-decades-rystad-says'&gt;雷斯塔称，俄罗斯炼油厂运行跌至数十年来最低水平&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Russian Refinery Runs Plunge to Lowest in Decades, Rystad Says&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/russian-refinery-runs-plunge-to-lowest-in-decades-rystad-says</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:38:16 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[纽约时报] 范霍伦对舒默的挑战凸显了以色列的民主分歧</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/us/politics/van-hollen-schumer-israel-senate.html</link><description>参议员克里斯·范·霍伦表示，他取代参议员查克·舒默担任党魁的举动与以色列无关，但他对犹太国家的尖锐批评立场已成为竞选中的主要断层线。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/us/politics/van-hollen-schumer-israel-senate.html'&gt;范霍伦对舒默的挑战凸显了以色列的民主分歧&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Van Hollen’s Challenge to Schumer Highlights Democratic Rift on Israel&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/us/politics/van-hollen-schumer-israel-senate.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:41:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 随着人工智能担忧加剧，CoreWeave 和 Nvidia 信用风险创下新高</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/coreweave-nvidia-credit-risk-hit-fresh-highs-as-ai-fears-mount</link><description>CoreWeave Inc. 和 Nvidia Corp. 的信用风险指标周三创下历史新高，同时，随着华尔街对科技行业为人工智能融资而创纪录的借贷越来越担忧，人们的担忧情绪再次达到 3 月份的水平。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/coreweave-nvidia-credit-risk-hit-fresh-highs-as-ai-fears-mount'&gt;随着人工智能担忧加剧，CoreWeave 和 Nvidia 信用风险创下新高&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：CoreWeave, Nvidia Credit Risk Hit Fresh Highs as AI Fears Mount&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/coreweave-nvidia-credit-risk-hit-fresh-highs-as-ai-fears-mount</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:44:02 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] Anthropic 首次公开募股后的困境与 SpaceX 的早期形成鲜明对比</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/anthropic-s-post-ipo-struggles-contrast-with-spacex-s-early-days</link><description>Anthropic PBC 正在经历比 SpaceX 更艰难的上市进程，在这家克劳德开发商明年初首次作为上市公司发布报告之前，一系列市场和技术因素可能会拖累其股票表现。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/anthropic-s-post-ipo-struggles-contrast-with-spacex-s-early-days'&gt;Anthropic 首次公开募股后的困境与 SpaceX 的早期形成鲜明对比&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Anthropic’s Post-IPO Struggles Contrast With SpaceX’s Early Days&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/anthropic-s-post-ipo-struggles-contrast-with-spacex-s-early-days</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:45:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 秘鲁力争在年底前解决非正式采矿纠纷</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/peru-races-to-resolve-informal-mining-fight-by-year-end-deadline</link><description>秘鲁正在竞相在年底截止日期前彻底修改管理数以万计的非正规采矿者的规定，政府警告说，否则可能会在一夜之间将他们推向非法状态。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/peru-races-to-resolve-informal-mining-fight-by-year-end-deadline'&gt;秘鲁力争在年底前解决非正式采矿纠纷&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Peru Races to Resolve Informal Mining Fight by Year-End Deadline&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/peru-races-to-resolve-informal-mining-fight-by-year-end-deadline</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:55:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 萨尔瓦多终于从打击帮派中获得经济收益</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/el-salvador-finally-reaps-economic-gains-from-gang-crackdown</link><description>萨尔瓦多的经济命运终于开始与其安全状况的显着改善相匹配。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/el-salvador-finally-reaps-economic-gains-from-gang-crackdown'&gt;萨尔瓦多终于从打击帮派中获得经济收益&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：El Salvador Finally Reaps Economic Gains From Gang Crackdown&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/el-salvador-finally-reaps-economic-gains-from-gang-crackdown</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:55:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[纽约时报] 美国并未陷入衰退。尝试告诉许多美国人这一点。</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/us/economic-growth-recession-pessimism.html</link><description>最新的增长和招聘指标显示经济健康。苦苦挣扎的美国人并没有看到这一点。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/us/economic-growth-recession-pessimism.html'&gt;美国并未陷入衰退。尝试告诉许多美国人这一点。&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：The U.S. Isn’t in a Recession. Try Telling Many Americans That.&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/us/economic-growth-recession-pessimism.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:06:10 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 美国陆军引爆爱荷华州米德尔敦的爆炸物储藏室</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/us-army-detonates-explosives-cache-in-middletown-iowa-video</link><description>美国陆军炸毁了储存在爱荷华州一处设施中的五吨危险材料，早期迹象表明规划者已经避免了出现大量有毒铅云的最坏情况。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/us-army-detonates-explosives-cache-in-middletown-iowa-video'&gt;美国陆军引爆爱荷华州米德尔敦的爆炸物储藏室&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Army Detonates Explosives Cache in Middletown, Iowa&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/us-army-detonates-explosives-cache-in-middletown-iowa-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:11:46 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 迈克尔·伯里 (Michael Burry) 抛售纳斯达克看跌期权后，做多多于做空</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/michael-burry-is-more-long-than-short-after-dumping-nasdaq-puts</link><description>科技股的抛售使得投资者迈克尔·伯里(Michael Burry)在抛售以科技股为主的纳斯达克100指数的看跌期权后，他的股票多头头寸多于空头头寸。迈克尔·伯里因2008年做空美国抵押贷款市场而闻名。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/michael-burry-is-more-long-than-short-after-dumping-nasdaq-puts'&gt;迈克尔·伯里 (Michael Burry) 抛售纳斯达克看跌期权后，做多多于做空&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Michael Burry Is More Long Than Short After Dumping Nasdaq Puts&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/michael-burry-is-more-long-than-short-after-dumping-nasdaq-puts</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:18:09 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 黄金因加息前景和人工智能股票抛售而暴跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/gold-slumps-on-rate-hike-outlook-ai-stocks-selloff-video</link><description>由于股市持续抛售以及关键的通胀数据增强了对美联储进一步加息的押注，金价跌破每盎司 3,500 美元。金价下跌 3.7%，至每盎司 3,426.77 美元。近期金价暴跌步伐加快，上周金价暴跌近9%，有望连续第三个月跌幅超过6%。彭博社的迈克·麦格隆 (Mike McGlone) 加入讨论。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/gold-slumps-on-rate-hike-outlook-ai-stocks-selloff-video'&gt;黄金因加息前景和人工智能股票抛售而暴跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Gold Slumps on Rate Hike Outlook, AI Stocks Selloff&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/gold-slumps-on-rate-hike-outlook-ai-stocks-selloff-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:20:41 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 市场中值得庆幸的一件事</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/one-thing-in-markets-to-be-thankful-for</link><description>国债对冲再次发挥作用。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/one-thing-in-markets-to-be-thankful-for'&gt;市场中值得庆幸的一件事&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：One Thing In Markets To Be Thankful For&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/one-thing-in-markets-to-be-thankful-for</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:23:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] CoreWeave 的银行下周将出售 45 亿美元的元挂钩贷款</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/coreweave-s-banks-to-sell-4-5-billion-meta-tied-loan-next-week</link><description>CoreWeave Inc. 的摩根士丹利和三菱日联金融集团银行家最快将于下周准备出售 45 亿美元的贷款，融资由 Meta Platforms Inc. 的图形处理部门提供担保。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/coreweave-s-banks-to-sell-4-5-billion-meta-tied-loan-next-week'&gt;CoreWeave 的银行下周将出售 45 亿美元的元挂钩贷款&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：CoreWeave’s Banks to Sell $4.5 Billion Meta-Tied Loan Next Week&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/coreweave-s-banks-to-sell-4-5-billion-meta-tied-loan-next-week</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:25:23 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>